      "Walkthrough": {
        "line": 125,
        "text": "Walkthrough\nHead south towards the river. The River Skale Queen should be on the other side of it. You can use the ctrl-key to see the name of any foes within the range of the radar. they will appear in red on your screen."
      },
      "Dialogue": {
        "line": 134,
        "text": "Dialogue\nInitial dialogue\nArtemis the Ranger\n\"A horde of skale down by the river road has been hunting human prey to feed to their queen. You must put an end to this. If you can get them to flee into the woods, they should lead you right to her. Eliminate the skale queen and report back to me.\"\nAccept: \"I won’t let you down.\"\nDecline: \"I don’t think I’m ready for this!\"\nAsk: \"Come on, «name», you can handle this! Just scare the skale into the woods, then follow them to their queen. Kill her and return to me. You can do it!\"\nReward dialogue\nArtemis the Ranger\n\"Sir Tydus was right. There is something special about you. I have no doubt that you can be entrusted with a few skills. Use them wisely.\"\n\"Haversdan should be here in a moment if you desire further guidance.\"\nRetrieved from \"https://wiki.guildwars.com/index.php?title=Ranger_Test&oldid=2633335\"\nCategories:\nPrimary quests\nProphecies primary quests\nAscalon (pre-Searing) quests\nProphecies quests\nTyrian only quests\nRanger questsHidden category:\nPages using DynamicPageList dplreplace parser function"
      }
    },
